  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under UCC Section 2-706, when a buyer repudiates, the seller may resell and recover the contract-resale differential plus incidental damages. Here: $90,000 − $75,000 = $15,000 shortfall, plus $2,500 in storage and resale costs = $17,500 total.
Wrong (A): $15,000 reflects only the contract-resale differential and omits the $2,500 in incidental damages that Section 2-706 expressly allows.
